<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Maximise offers and set your business up for the year ahead</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033550866/Qantas_Business_Rewards_eDM_Banner2_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/login" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038233837/2202_QBR_Add_stored_traveller_680x355.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" alt="Qantas Business Rewards" width="680"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 26px;"></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px; font-weight: 400;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Add employees as travellers and grow Qantas Points<br>for your business</font></h2></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It's time to get your business back in the air to reconnect with colleagues and customers in more meaningful ways. It's also a good time to make sure you're maximising the value of your Qantas Business Rewards membership.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; width: 600px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">One of the best ways to do so is by storing traveller details</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Storing your team as travellers will save time when booking future flights. Plus, if you enable self-booking, your team members can book their own travel via qantas.com or the Qantas App, and earn points for your business^ as well as for themselves<span style="vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 12px; bottom: 0.3ex; position: relative;">+</span>. Plus, they'll be able to access your business's exclusive flight savings*.<br><br>Adding travellers will also enable you to see and manage all bookings in one place. And with the new reporting feature, every time a booking is made with your business ABN included, it will be stored in your account so you can reconcile travel expenses month on month.<span style="vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 12px; bottom: 0.3ex; position: relative;">~</span>&nbsp;Easy.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td><td align="left" valign="middle" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038233801/Icon_Qantas_Points_48x48.jpg" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; text-align: center;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong>500 bonus Qantas Points for every stored traveller</strong><br>As an added bonus, for every new traveller stored in your Qantas Business Rewards account, your business will earn a&nbsp;<strong>bonus of 500 Qantas Points</strong>.<span style="vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 12px; bottom: 0.3ex; position: relative;">&gt;</span>&nbsp;Hurry, this offer is only available until 31&nbsp;March 2022.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; width: 600px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to add travellers</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It's as simple as a few clicks once you're logged into your Qantas Business Rewards account:</font><ol style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;"><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Click 'Manage people' in your dashboard</font></span></li><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Select 'Add a traveller' and enter the details required</font></span></li><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Leave the 'enable self-booking' box checked and click 'Add'</font></span></li></ol></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Watch this short video for more detailed steps:</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://youtu.be/9GgbMqxOOQk" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038233821/QBR_STORED_TRAVELLER_60SEC_THUMBNAIL2.png" width="400px" align="center" style="display: block; width: 400px; align-content: center;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/login" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" title="Add Travellers Now" alt="" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038234285/Add_traveller_button-01.png" width="161" style="display: inline-block;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013844708/facebook.j